# --- 2. Backend (Rust/Cargo) ---
# We ignore the target directory where the heavy binaries are built
src-tauri/target/

# Cargo.lock is typically COMMITTED for "Apps" to ensure reproducible builds,
# but IGNORED for "Libraries." Since this is an App, I recommend NOT 
# adding it here unless you have a specific reason to avoid it.
# src-tauri/Cargo.lock

# --- 3. Tauri Build Artifacts ---
# Windows-specific WiX and NSIS build tools
src-tauri/WixTools/
src-tauri/NSIS/

# Tauri v2 Mobile artifacts (if you ever explore Android/iOS)
src-tauri/gen/
src-tauri/platforms/
*.keystore
key.properties

